---
title: "repay_flash_loan (Pebble Protocol: Flash Loan)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_version: ensure_version_matches()
    q_version --> q_validate: validate_market(market)
    q_validate --> q_emit: emit RepayFlashLoanEvent
    q_emit --> q_referral: referral = app.referral_mut()
    q_referral --> q_repay: market.repay_flash_loan(coin, loan, referral, none, ctx)
    q_repay --> q_check_ongoing: assert flash_loan_ongoing
    q_check_ongoing --> q_unlock: flash_loan_finished()
    q_unlock --> q_check_amount: assert coin.value() == loan.amount + fee
    q_check_amount --> q_split_fee: fee_coin = coin.split(fee, ctx)
    q_split_fee --> q_reserve_repay: reserve.repay_flash_loan(inner, coin, fee_coin)
    q_reserve_repay --> q_verify_amount: assert coin.value() == amount
    q_verify_amount --> q_deposit: underlying_balance.join(coin)
    q_deposit --> q_fee_check: fee.value() == 0?
    q_fee_check --> q_fee_zero: fee == 0, destroy_zero
    q_fee_zero --> [*]: return
    q_fee_check --> q_fee_nonzero: fee > 0
    q_fee_nonzero --> q_increase_reserve: increase_reserve_only(fee)
    q_increase_reserve --> [*]: return

    note right of q_check_amount
        INV-001: repay amount must exactly equal borrowed amount + fee
        INV-002: flash_loan_lock is released after repay
        INV-003: fee goes entirely to cash_reserve (protocol revenue)
        INV-004: hot potato FlashLoan is consumed (destroyed)
    end note
